1
00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:46,840
I really want to be buried in Australia.

2
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:51,160
I can be myself there.

3
00:00:56,360 --> 00:00:58,320
I've never asked you for anything in my life.

4
00:01:01,280 --> 00:01:02,840
Please help me just this once.

5
00:01:06,520 --> 00:01:07,800
Let me die in peace.

6
00:02:06,280 --> 00:02:07,960
Do you remember this puppy?

7
00:02:10,920 --> 00:02:12,560
It was Sze Ming's favorite when she was little.

8
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:16,320
She even named it Bo Bo.

9
00:02:19,760 --> 00:02:21,200
She took it everywhere, even on trips.

10
00:02:25,480 --> 00:02:27,120
Once, she left it at the hotel.

11
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:29,400
She cried so hard.

12
00:02:30,480 --> 00:02:31,960
We had to go back to get it.

13
00:02:36,160 --> 00:02:37,800
We almost missed our flight.

14
00:02:41,360 --> 00:02:43,160
She always begged for a dog as a child.

15
00:02:44,040 --> 00:02:46,040
But we never agreed.

16
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:49,360
And this.

17
00:02:50,640 --> 00:02:53,760
I forget if it was third or fourth grade.

18
00:02:55,360 --> 00:02:57,280
The topic was "My Favorite Place".

19
00:02:58,320 --> 00:03:04,040
Her classmates all made zoos and such.

20
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:06,920
This silly girl built her own home.

21
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:21,720
I don't know when it started,

22
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:24,960
but our daughter drifted away from us.

23
00:03:28,200 --> 00:03:29,520
It's all my fault.

24
00:03:30,960 --> 00:03:33,120
I should have spent more time with her.

25
00:03:33,200 --> 00:03:35,000
I should have understood her better.

26
00:05:14,400 --> 00:05:16,799
(Episode 9)

27
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:18,520
(This is a work of fiction.)

28
00:05:18,880 --> 00:05:19,880
(Conflicted! Choose His Daughter or His Political Career?)

29
00:05:19,880 --> 00:05:20,880
(Thankful he's not my father. Cold-blooded!)

30
00:05:20,880 --> 00:05:21,880
(Ma Kwan Ho Ignores Daughter-in-law To Protect His Political Career!)

31
00:05:21,880 --> 00:05:22,880
(He doesn't care about his daughter. Why would he care about citizens?)

32
00:05:22,881 --> 00:05:24,320
(Persist to the end! I'm voting for you! Protect the children!)

33
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:26,400
(Say it with me! Ma Kwan Ho, I support you!)

34
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:28,160
(Glory Society Member Ma Kwan Ho Hid Daughter's Sexual Orientation)

35
00:05:28,920 --> 00:05:31,360
This is a huge political scandal.

36
00:05:31,440 --> 00:05:34,999
Being a member of the Glory Society,

37
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:36,199
Ma Kwan Ho is vocally anti-gay,

38
00:05:36,200 --> 00:05:38,200
but his daughter was actually a lesbian.

39
00:05:38,280 --> 00:05:40,040
She was even married.

40
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:42,119
It's quite a juicy scandal.

41
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:43,120
But then again,

42
00:05:43,121 --> 00:05:45,680
he didn't violate any legal ethics.

43
00:05:45,760 --> 00:05:47,840
It's a matter of public perception.

44
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:51,240
As a representative, he should be open.

45
00:05:51,520 --> 00:05:54,040
But we've never heard him...

46
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:56,040
speak publicly about his daughter.

47
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:59,280
Yet, we see him and his daughter-in-law...

48
00:05:59,360 --> 00:06:00,680
fighting over the body in court.

49
00:06:00,760 --> 00:06:02,520
That's a bit of a blow to his image.

50
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:04,160
But on the other hand,

51
00:06:04,240 --> 00:06:05,720
this act of putting duty before family...

52
00:06:05,800 --> 00:06:08,440
proves how firm his stance is.

53
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:11,520
He's even ruthless to his daughter's wife.

54
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:12,600
That's actually quite impressive.

55
00:06:12,601 --> 00:06:16,640
It's like what my friend Muhammad says.

56
00:06:16,880 --> 00:06:18,240
"There's nothing to lose."

57
00:06:19,080 --> 00:06:20,560
His daughter dies before the election,

58
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:22,720
so he uses a lawsuit to get votes.

59
00:06:22,920 --> 00:06:24,159
That's incredible.

60
00:06:24,160 --> 00:06:26,680
(Is Ma Kwan Ho's Career At a Crossroads?)

61
00:06:34,600 --> 00:06:35,800
Do you know what to say later?

62
00:06:36,800 --> 00:06:37,800
Want to try it once?

63
00:06:38,200 --> 00:06:39,200
No need.

64
00:06:45,280 --> 00:06:46,800
Here he comes.

65
00:06:49,280 --> 00:06:50,760
Mr. Ma, regarding your anti-gay stance,

66
00:06:50,840 --> 00:06:52,800
how do you respond to your daughter being a lesbian?

67
00:06:52,880 --> 00:06:53,920
Have you been hiding the fact...

68
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:55,320
that your daughter was a lesbian?

69
00:06:55,480 --> 00:06:56,880
Or was it because of a poor relationship...

70
00:06:56,960 --> 00:06:57,960
that you were completely unaware?

71
00:06:58,040 --> 00:06:59,840
Many think you're cold-blooded and ignoring her final wishes.

72
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:01,880
Do you still insist on cremating your daughter in Hong Kong?

73
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:04,120
Mr. Ma, please respond.

74
00:07:16,840 --> 00:07:17,840
First of all,

75
00:07:18,640 --> 00:07:20,640
my daughter and I were always very close.

76
00:07:22,160 --> 00:07:24,399
We did have some minor misunderstandings...

77
00:07:24,400 --> 00:07:25,680
and arguments.

78
00:07:28,160 --> 00:07:30,680
But what father and daughter don't?

79
00:07:33,280 --> 00:07:34,600
In a fit of pique,

80
00:07:35,080 --> 00:07:37,400
she married a woman just to spite me.

81
00:07:38,880 --> 00:07:39,880
I don't blame her.

82
00:07:42,760 --> 00:07:44,240
I blame...

83
00:07:44,520 --> 00:07:46,680
that so-called "wife" with ulterior motives.

84
00:07:47,240 --> 00:07:50,560
She's using this to seek the limelight...

85
00:07:50,640 --> 00:07:51,840
and promote homosexuality.

86
00:07:54,280 --> 00:07:56,640
As her father, I am 100 percent certain...

87
00:07:56,720 --> 00:07:58,480
that my daughter liked men.

88
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:02,760
To protect my daughter...

89
00:08:03,200 --> 00:08:05,040
and traditional Chinese values,

90
00:08:05,600 --> 00:08:07,080
I won't let her take my daughter away.

91
00:08:07,160 --> 00:08:08,760
I will fight her to the very end.

92
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:11,280
This is too much.

93
00:08:11,360 --> 00:08:12,360
I reiterate.

94
00:08:12,361 --> 00:08:13,480
How can he be such a father?

95
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:16,560
Regarding the government's policy on same-sex partners,

96
00:08:16,760 --> 00:08:18,720
I will continue the judicial review.

97
00:08:19,280 --> 00:08:20,360
I won't budge an inch.

98
00:08:21,280 --> 00:08:22,360
You can all rest assured.

99
00:08:26,360 --> 00:08:27,800
Your way won't work!

100
00:08:34,680 --> 00:08:35,760
Calm down.

101
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:42,800
Is he really my father?

102
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:44,520
Why is he doing this to me?

103
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:47,560
Don't do this.

104
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:49,760
You will be reduced to ashes if you go on like this.

105
00:08:51,360 --> 00:08:52,920
I want him to go down with me.

106
00:08:54,640 --> 00:08:55,640
Senior.

107
00:08:57,680 --> 00:09:00,000
Senior.

108
00:09:00,400 --> 00:09:01,400
Senior?

109
00:09:01,760 --> 00:09:03,680
- Senior! - Is Senior here?

110
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:10,040
Master.

111
00:09:15,920 --> 00:09:17,400
To protect my daughter...

112
00:09:17,920 --> 00:09:19,600
and traditional Chinese values,

113
00:09:20,880 --> 00:09:22,280
I won't let her take my daughter away.

114
00:09:22,400 --> 00:09:24,000
I'll fight her to the very end.

115
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:27,360
At the same time, I reiterate,

116
00:09:27,680 --> 00:09:30,680
regarding the government's policy on same-sex couples,

117
00:09:30,920 --> 00:09:32,960
I will continue the judicial review.

118
00:09:33,160 --> 00:09:34,160
I won't budge an inch.

119
00:09:35,400 --> 00:09:36,400
Why?

120
00:09:38,560 --> 00:09:41,000
You didn't care about Sze Ming when she was alive.

121
00:09:42,480 --> 00:09:43,600
Now that she has passed away,

122
00:09:44,040 --> 00:09:47,120
you tell the whole world you want to protect her?

123
00:09:54,920 --> 00:09:57,360
It's because I didn't discipline her properly before.

124
00:09:59,400 --> 00:10:00,400
That's why she ended up like this.

125
00:10:02,280 --> 00:10:03,480
I regret it deeply.

126
00:10:05,720 --> 00:10:08,400
Now that I have a chance to set things right,

127
00:10:09,760 --> 00:10:11,040
of course I must persevere.

128
00:10:13,160 --> 00:10:15,360
This is the only thing I can do for her now.

129
00:10:51,600 --> 00:10:52,600
Hey!

130
00:11:55,800 --> 00:11:57,880
Cockroach, Daddy!

131
00:11:57,960 --> 00:11:59,440
Where? Where is the cockroach?

132
00:11:59,520 --> 00:12:00,520
There.

133
00:12:02,920 --> 00:12:04,880
Cockroach.

134
00:12:05,160 --> 00:12:06,720
It's gone.

135
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:08,000
It's gone.

136
00:12:08,560 --> 00:12:09,800
There!

137
00:12:10,120 --> 00:12:11,240
Didn't you say it was gone?

138
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:14,080
I stepped on it.

139
00:12:14,320 --> 00:12:15,880
It's gone.

140
00:12:16,520 --> 00:12:18,920
It's broken.

141
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:20,040
What's wrong?

142
00:12:20,120 --> 00:12:22,480
It won't move.

143
00:12:23,200 --> 00:12:24,560
Don't cry.

144
00:12:24,760 --> 00:12:27,960
Daddy will fix it for you, okay?

145
00:12:28,400 --> 00:12:29,400
Don't cry.

146
00:13:15,080 --> 00:13:18,400
Mr. Ma.

147
00:14:47,440 --> 00:14:48,440
Hello?

148
00:14:48,640 --> 00:14:51,360
Master, are you okay? I've been looking for you.

149
00:14:52,200 --> 00:14:54,520
Hello?

150
00:14:54,600 --> 00:14:55,640
I'm fine.

151
00:14:55,960 --> 00:14:57,199
Just now, you suddenly started talking to thin air...

152
00:14:57,200 --> 00:14:58,239
about being reduced to ashes.

153
00:14:58,240 --> 00:15:00,720
Then you called for Senior and suddenly ran off.

154
00:15:00,840 --> 00:15:02,920
You scared me. Are you possessed?

155
00:15:03,280 --> 00:15:04,280
I'm fine.

156
00:15:05,720 --> 00:15:07,400
How much dirt did you find on Counselor Ma?

157
00:15:08,360 --> 00:15:10,400
Sorry, I tried my best.

158
00:15:10,480 --> 00:15:12,120
But I really couldn't find anything.

159
00:15:12,840 --> 00:15:13,840
Thanks.

160
00:15:20,320 --> 00:15:21,320
Hello, Ben.

161
00:15:21,880 --> 00:15:23,880
Did you find any dirt on Counselor Ma?

162
00:15:24,520 --> 00:15:26,560
No, he's squeaky clean.

163
00:15:27,120 --> 00:15:28,200
Alan and I couldn't find anything.

164
00:15:41,480 --> 00:15:42,480
What is she doing here?

165
00:15:43,280 --> 00:15:45,200
Luckily, Cathy passed by and found you.

166
00:15:45,280 --> 00:15:46,720
Otherwise, who knows what might have happened?

167
00:15:54,080 --> 00:15:56,280
Why were you there?

168
00:15:57,560 --> 00:15:59,240
Did you know I would be attacked?

169
00:15:59,800 --> 00:16:02,200
She saved you. How could you say that?

170
00:16:03,200 --> 00:16:05,280
I'm sorry. He might not be in his right mind.

171
00:16:05,800 --> 00:16:07,040
I was there...

172
00:16:07,360 --> 00:16:08,720
because I came specifically to see you.

173
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:14,800
I want to ask you not to cremate Sze Ming.

174
00:16:16,560 --> 00:16:17,600
That's impossible.

175
00:16:20,160 --> 00:16:21,480
You can hold a funeral for her,

176
00:16:21,560 --> 00:16:23,320
but please don't cremate her.

177
00:16:23,760 --> 00:16:24,760
Being buried in Australia...

178
00:16:24,840 --> 00:16:26,360
really was your daughter's wish.

179
00:16:26,440 --> 00:16:27,560
I beg you.

180
00:16:32,640 --> 00:16:34,280
Let her go back to Australia.

181
00:16:35,080 --> 00:16:37,200
I also believe that is what Sze Ming wants.

182
00:16:40,640 --> 00:16:42,920
Enough, I don't want to hear it. Leave.

183
00:16:49,560 --> 00:16:50,560
Please go.

184
00:16:51,440 --> 00:16:53,960
Let's go. Let's go back first.

185
00:16:59,880 --> 00:17:02,760
- Counselor Ma. - Counselor Ma.

186
00:17:02,840 --> 00:17:04,080
Calm down, everyone.

187
00:17:04,440 --> 00:17:05,840
Counselor Ma has something to say.

188
00:17:06,600 --> 00:17:08,040
Let Counselor Ma speak first.

189
00:17:10,000 --> 00:17:12,400
The assailant strangled me this time,

190
00:17:12,760 --> 00:17:14,560
almost causing fatal injuries.

191
00:17:16,080 --> 00:17:19,040
Luckily, with the medical staff's efforts,

192
00:17:19,080 --> 00:17:20,560
I'm fine now.

193
00:17:20,840 --> 00:17:22,320
You can all rest assured.

194
00:17:22,600 --> 00:17:23,720
Do you know who attacked you?

195
00:17:23,800 --> 00:17:25,080
Is it related to the election?

196
00:17:25,320 --> 00:17:27,000
Do you still have the energy to run?

197
00:17:29,240 --> 00:17:30,840
Actually, since I entered politics,

198
00:17:31,320 --> 00:17:33,600
I've received death threats more than once.

199
00:17:34,600 --> 00:17:38,000
But this is the first time I've been physically harmed.

200
00:17:39,920 --> 00:17:41,480
The culprit's intention is obvious.

201
00:17:42,000 --> 00:17:44,200
They want me to be scared and shut up.

202
00:17:45,080 --> 00:17:47,520
But I, Ma Kwan Ho, can guarantee you,

203
00:17:48,200 --> 00:17:50,720
I will never bow down to evil forces.

204
00:17:51,160 --> 00:17:53,080
I will continue to stand by my principles,

205
00:17:53,560 --> 00:17:56,160
do real work for society and the public.

206
00:17:56,240 --> 00:17:58,280
Please support candidate number one, Ma Kwan Ho.

207
00:18:08,800 --> 00:18:10,520
Can you help me talk to him again?

208
00:18:13,320 --> 00:18:15,040
I'm just a weak woman.

209
00:18:15,720 --> 00:18:16,720
Why would he listen to me?

210
00:18:26,040 --> 00:18:27,040
This is for you.

211
00:18:34,080 --> 00:18:36,480
This was Sze Ming's favorite toy when she was little.

212
00:18:38,600 --> 00:18:42,600
She always wanted a dog.

213
00:18:45,240 --> 00:18:46,400
But her father didn't like them.

214
00:18:47,720 --> 00:18:49,320
So we never let her have one.

215
00:18:52,200 --> 00:18:54,560
Then I saw your photos...

216
00:18:56,480 --> 00:19:00,080
and saw that she finally got to have a dog.

217
00:19:05,320 --> 00:19:07,800
I know you truly loved my daughter.

218
00:19:11,000 --> 00:19:12,160
But I'm sorry.

219
00:19:14,400 --> 00:19:15,840
I don't think I can help you.

220
00:19:32,160 --> 00:19:33,160
Senior.

221
00:19:34,600 --> 00:19:35,600
Come out.

222
00:19:36,320 --> 00:19:37,560
I need to talk to you.

223
00:19:43,840 --> 00:19:45,600
What exactly did you do in my body?

224
00:19:47,200 --> 00:19:48,200
Kill my dad.

225
00:19:50,080 --> 00:19:51,560
How could you do such a thing?

226
00:19:51,840 --> 00:19:54,680
If you kill him in my body, it's like I killed him.

227
00:19:54,760 --> 00:19:56,040
I would get life in prison.

228
00:19:56,320 --> 00:19:59,280
I hate him so much, but I'm powerless.

229
00:19:59,680 --> 00:20:02,480
I can only watch him cremate me!

230
00:20:03,160 --> 00:20:04,520
You know I will have a way.

231
00:20:04,600 --> 00:20:05,960
Why were you so impulsive?

232
00:20:06,320 --> 00:20:07,520
What way?

233
00:20:07,920 --> 00:20:09,720
More of those lousy ideas about visiting dreams?

234
00:20:09,800 --> 00:20:11,920
They don't work! You gave me false hope!

235
00:20:12,320 --> 00:20:13,840
I thought since you're father and daughter,

236
00:20:13,960 --> 00:20:15,080
I shouldn't be too harsh from the start.

237
00:20:15,160 --> 00:20:16,800
That's why I suggested other ways.

238
00:20:17,440 --> 00:20:19,480
So what other plan do you have?

239
00:20:22,160 --> 00:20:23,960
I didn't want it to come to this.

240
00:20:25,080 --> 00:20:26,280
But we're out of time.

241
00:20:29,720 --> 00:20:30,920
The agenda for tomorrow's party meeting.

242
00:20:31,600 --> 00:20:32,880
Is my platform updated?

243
00:20:35,800 --> 00:20:37,480
I want to talk about your daughter.

244
00:20:37,920 --> 00:20:39,040
I have nothing to say to you.

245
00:20:39,840 --> 00:20:41,520
I know Sze Ming visited your dreams.

246
00:20:42,000 --> 00:20:43,600
Because she visited mine too.

247
00:20:49,920 --> 00:20:51,360
Make it quick. I'm busy.

248
00:20:52,760 --> 00:20:55,600
She said it's fine if you cremate her here.

249
00:20:55,680 --> 00:20:57,280
But she wants you to do a few things.

250
00:20:58,240 --> 00:21:01,120
She hopes that during her funeral,

251
00:21:01,640 --> 00:21:03,560
you will act with her best interests at heart.

252
00:21:03,640 --> 00:21:04,880
Keep her in your thoughts.

253
00:21:05,800 --> 00:21:07,440
Then she can move on in peace.

254
00:21:09,480 --> 00:21:11,360
She really told you that in a dream?

255
00:21:11,840 --> 00:21:13,320
Why would I lie about this?

256
00:21:14,160 --> 00:21:15,320
Will you keep her in your thoughts?

257
00:21:27,320 --> 00:21:28,320
Senior?

258
00:21:29,200 --> 00:21:31,160
Hurry, we only have half an hour.

259
00:21:52,880 --> 00:21:53,880
Thank you.

260
00:22:04,440 --> 00:22:05,440
I'll drive you.

261
00:22:08,360 --> 00:22:09,360
No need.

262
00:22:13,680 --> 00:22:14,680
Be careful.

263
00:23:09,840 --> 00:23:10,840
What do you want?

264
00:23:10,841 --> 00:23:12,200
You know too many of my secrets.

265
00:23:12,400 --> 00:23:13,920
It makes me very uneasy.

266
00:23:16,160 --> 00:23:17,160
Do you want to kill me?

267
00:23:18,280 --> 00:23:19,320
What era do you think this is?

268
00:23:20,360 --> 00:23:21,480
Do you really think you can get away?

269
00:23:22,120 --> 00:23:23,320
I don't need to kill you.

270
00:23:23,400 --> 00:23:25,080
I just need to get some leverage on you...

271
00:23:25,400 --> 00:23:26,640
to put my mind at ease.

272
00:23:29,880 --> 00:23:32,000
Careful, this bitch can fight.

273
00:23:38,440 --> 00:23:40,800
Wench, I thought you could fight!

274
00:23:50,160 --> 00:23:51,160
Jerk!

275
00:24:25,640 --> 00:24:26,640
Ben!

276
00:24:34,640 --> 00:24:36,920
What are you doing? I've called the police!

277
00:24:46,640 --> 00:24:47,640
Amber.

278
00:25:51,440 --> 00:25:52,440
- Nurse. - Yes?

279
00:25:52,441 --> 00:25:54,040
Where is the woman who was admitted with me just now?

280
00:26:03,280 --> 00:26:04,280
Are you awake?

281
00:26:06,200 --> 00:26:07,200
How are you?

282
00:26:09,600 --> 00:26:10,600
What about you?

283
00:26:12,360 --> 00:26:14,960
I'm fine. The doctor said no vital organs were hit.

284
00:26:15,200 --> 00:26:16,200
I'll be discharged soon.

285
00:26:18,320 --> 00:26:19,320
That's good.

286
00:26:23,400 --> 00:26:24,880
I think I'm fine too.

287
00:26:26,680 --> 00:26:27,680
That's good.

288
00:26:29,320 --> 00:26:30,880
Dee has been arrested.

289
00:26:31,600 --> 00:26:33,160
We should be safe for now.

290
00:26:39,160 --> 00:26:40,440
Why did you come over?

291
00:26:42,680 --> 00:26:44,840
I forgot to give you something earlier.

292
00:26:45,560 --> 00:26:47,240
I was trying to catch up to give it to you.

293
00:26:47,800 --> 00:26:48,960
I didn't expect to run into that.

294
00:26:50,280 --> 00:26:51,280
For you.

295
00:26:52,480 --> 00:26:53,840
This is a hidden edition.

296
00:26:54,480 --> 00:26:56,120
Its expression looks just like yours.

297
00:26:58,120 --> 00:27:00,320
You didn't have to rush just to give me a figurine.

298
00:27:01,600 --> 00:27:02,720
Couldn't you give it to me next time?

299
00:27:04,520 --> 00:27:06,920
I was afraid I would forget next time.

300
00:27:10,960 --> 00:27:12,320
This grumpy face looks just like you.

301
00:27:12,600 --> 00:27:15,200
You're actually quite cute.

302
00:27:22,920 --> 00:27:23,920
Amber.

303
00:27:25,080 --> 00:27:26,640
Can I ask you a favor?

304
00:27:28,920 --> 00:27:31,840
Actually, I've never been able to get over my mom's suicide.

305
00:27:33,080 --> 00:27:35,560
If you have a chance to go down there again,

306
00:27:36,000 --> 00:27:37,400
could you help me find her?

307
00:27:38,760 --> 00:27:41,160
Ask her how she's doing...

308
00:27:42,240 --> 00:27:43,520
and why she did it.

309
00:27:45,880 --> 00:27:47,920
It's not like I can just go down there whenever I want.

310
00:27:48,920 --> 00:27:51,000
But if there's a next time, I'll definitely help you.

311
00:27:53,680 --> 00:27:54,680
Thank you.

312
00:28:01,320 --> 00:28:02,320
What's the date today?

313
00:28:04,640 --> 00:28:05,640
The 13th.

314
00:28:06,560 --> 00:28:07,560
Oh, no.

315
00:28:07,880 --> 00:28:09,240
(Return Condolence Gift)

316
00:28:11,000 --> 00:28:12,000
Thank you for coming.

317
00:28:13,760 --> 00:28:15,039
(For the Late Ms. Ma Sze Ming)

318
00:28:15,040 --> 00:28:16,040
A guest has arrived.

319
00:28:18,520 --> 00:28:19,520
First bow.

320
00:28:23,600 --> 00:28:24,600
Second bow.

321
00:28:24,601 --> 00:28:25,799
(Forever In Our Memories)

322
00:28:25,800 --> 00:28:27,000
(Remembered Fondly)

323
00:28:28,480 --> 00:28:29,480
Third bow.

324
00:28:31,640 --> 00:28:32,799
(In Loving Memory)

325
00:28:32,800 --> 00:28:34,240
Guest, please be seated.

326
00:28:35,840 --> 00:28:37,920
Mr. and Mrs. Ma, my condolences.

327
00:28:39,760 --> 00:28:40,760
Thank you.

328
00:28:42,480 --> 00:28:43,480
Take care.

329
00:29:00,960 --> 00:29:04,159
(The Ma Family Memorial Service)

330
00:29:04,160 --> 00:29:05,240
A guest has arrived.

331
00:29:20,000 --> 00:29:21,280
Guest, please wait.

332
00:29:22,120 --> 00:29:23,120
First bow.

333
00:29:27,000 --> 00:29:28,040
Second bow.

334
00:29:30,800 --> 00:29:31,800
Third bow.

335
00:29:36,040 --> 00:29:37,520
Guest, please be seated.

336
00:29:49,440 --> 00:29:50,759
After I see her, I'll go straight to the airport...

337
00:29:50,760 --> 00:29:51,800
to return to Australia.

338
00:29:58,360 --> 00:29:59,600
I hope you can give me some space...

339
00:29:59,680 --> 00:30:00,680
to be alone with Sze Ming...

340
00:30:01,760 --> 00:30:02,760
one last time.

341
00:30:14,560 --> 00:30:15,760
I won't let anyone disturb you.

342
00:30:16,440 --> 00:30:17,440
Take your time.

343
00:32:52,320 --> 00:32:53,440
A guest has arrived.

344
00:32:58,680 --> 00:33:00,120
Guest, please stay.

345
00:33:00,680 --> 00:33:01,720
First bow.

346
00:33:04,280 --> 00:33:05,320
Second bow.

347
00:33:08,760 --> 00:33:09,800
Third bow.

348
00:33:13,600 --> 00:33:15,000
Guests, please be seated.

349
00:33:24,400 --> 00:33:25,760
I have something to talk to you about.

350
00:33:29,840 --> 00:33:30,960
Whatever it is, make it quick.

351
00:33:32,720 --> 00:33:35,520
It's about your political future.

352
00:33:37,000 --> 00:33:38,120
Are you sure you want to talk here?

353
00:33:40,760 --> 00:33:41,960
My political future?

354
00:33:43,040 --> 00:33:44,720
You think you're in a position to talk to me?

355
00:33:52,720 --> 00:33:53,720
Cathy?

356
00:33:55,600 --> 00:33:56,600
Cathy.

357
00:34:08,600 --> 00:34:09,600
Cathy?

358
00:34:16,280 --> 00:34:17,280
Honey!

359
00:34:18,560 --> 00:34:19,560
Honey!

360
00:34:19,800 --> 00:34:20,800
What's wrong?

361
00:34:21,000 --> 00:34:22,040
Honey!

362
00:34:25,480 --> 00:34:27,160
Sze Ming is gone!

363
00:34:34,680 --> 00:34:35,960
What's happening?

364
00:34:36,680 --> 00:34:38,640
I think I heard Mrs. Ma shout out that Sze Ming is gone.

365
00:34:38,920 --> 00:34:40,160
That's so creepy.

366
00:34:40,440 --> 00:34:42,240
How can a whole body just disappear?

367
00:34:46,120 --> 00:34:47,120
Stop right there!

368
00:34:47,800 --> 00:34:49,880
Don't go! Come back!

369
00:34:50,560 --> 00:34:51,560
Where are you going?

370
00:34:51,800 --> 00:34:52,800
Let's go after them.

371
00:35:22,960 --> 00:35:23,960
Hello?

372
00:35:24,280 --> 00:35:25,280
Hello, Cathy.

373
00:35:26,040 --> 00:35:28,080
I found a way to help you. Stop the car.

374
00:35:28,880 --> 00:35:30,160
You don't have to comfort me.

375
00:35:30,520 --> 00:35:31,880
I know you did your best.

376
00:35:34,120 --> 00:35:35,600
But I can't give up.

377
00:35:36,040 --> 00:35:37,960
I have to try until the very end.

378
00:35:39,320 --> 00:35:41,000
No matter what the result is,

379
00:35:41,880 --> 00:35:43,120
I'm willing to do it.

380
00:35:43,600 --> 00:35:44,600
I won't regret it.

381
00:35:45,640 --> 00:35:46,920
I'm not just comforting you.

382
00:35:47,000 --> 00:35:49,080
I really have a way. Pull over.

383
00:35:49,680 --> 00:35:50,680
Cathy.

384
00:35:53,120 --> 00:35:54,120
Cathy.

385
00:36:10,000 --> 00:36:11,000
Do you know them?

386
00:36:11,800 --> 00:36:12,800
Ignore him.

387
00:36:22,240 --> 00:36:23,840
Are you filming a car chase?

388
00:36:24,040 --> 00:36:25,480
This is very dangerous.

389
00:36:26,920 --> 00:36:28,000
What are you doing?

390
00:36:28,360 --> 00:36:29,840
You guys talk it out first.

391
00:36:39,240 --> 00:36:41,320
Come out.

392
00:36:44,120 --> 00:36:45,480
Give my daughter back now, and I'll let this go.

393
00:36:45,560 --> 00:36:46,560
Otherwise, I'll call the police immediately.

394
00:36:46,920 --> 00:36:48,000
You're using her as a tool to get votes.

395
00:36:48,080 --> 00:36:49,360
I won't let you exploit her.

396
00:36:50,440 --> 00:36:52,040
There's a body in her suitcase.

397
00:36:52,400 --> 00:36:54,000
Open the trunk now.

398
00:36:54,160 --> 00:36:55,760
I'll testify that you didn't know.

399
00:36:56,160 --> 00:36:57,160
Don't.

400
00:37:00,600 --> 00:37:02,960
No, please don't!

401
00:37:03,880 --> 00:37:07,440
No! Please don't!

402
00:37:07,880 --> 00:37:09,400
Give Sze Ming back to Cathy now.

403
00:37:09,720 --> 00:37:10,800
And I might let you off the hook.

404
00:37:12,880 --> 00:37:14,840
Do you even know what you're saying?

405
00:37:15,400 --> 00:37:17,280
You'll know once you see this.

406
00:37:31,320 --> 00:37:33,240
I didn't expect you to hide it so well.

407
00:37:34,000 --> 00:37:36,760
Your boyfriend is quite handsome.

408
00:37:42,400 --> 00:37:43,640
That's not me.

409
00:37:43,720 --> 00:37:44,840
I'll turn up the volume for you.

410
00:37:45,200 --> 00:37:47,480
- I miss you so much. - Me too.

411
00:37:50,600 --> 00:37:51,840
It's been hard on you lately,

412
00:37:52,760 --> 00:37:54,720
getting those idiot voters to vote for me.

413
00:37:54,880 --> 00:37:55,880
Once I win,

414
00:37:56,400 --> 00:37:58,240
we'll have plenty of time to see each other.

415
00:38:00,360 --> 00:38:01,400
This is AI-generated.

416
00:38:01,480 --> 00:38:03,560
Want to see the parking lot CCTV footage?

417
00:38:04,920 --> 00:38:06,360
Don't touch me! Get away!

418
00:38:06,880 --> 00:38:08,760
Actually, being gay is not a problem.

419
00:38:09,280 --> 00:38:11,880
But being dishonest with yourself and your voters is.

420
00:38:12,160 --> 00:38:13,520
That's where the problem lies.

421
00:38:14,040 --> 00:38:15,080
I'm not gay.

422
00:38:15,160 --> 00:38:16,800
Then your other personality is.

423
00:38:17,160 --> 00:38:19,320
No, I'm just not.

424
00:38:19,400 --> 00:38:21,800
I get it. Homophobia is a sign of being deeply closeted.

425
00:38:21,960 --> 00:38:22,960
I understand.

426
00:38:24,800 --> 00:38:26,880
You jerk, shut your mouth.

427
00:38:27,840 --> 00:38:28,840
What do you want?

428
00:38:58,680 --> 00:39:00,400
Testing. Do you copy?

429
00:39:01,120 --> 00:39:02,840
Yes, loud and clear.

430
00:39:04,360 --> 00:39:06,920
Ready and action.

431
00:39:18,400 --> 00:39:20,640
Hurry up. We're out of time.

432
00:39:33,440 --> 00:39:36,080
Don't waste time. Kiss!

433
00:39:53,480 --> 00:39:55,200
He's coming out.

434
00:39:57,960 --> 00:39:58,960
Folks,

435
00:39:59,760 --> 00:40:01,520
after much deliberation...

436
00:40:02,800 --> 00:40:04,480
and after listening to various opinions,

437
00:40:04,560 --> 00:40:07,000
including those of my wife,

438
00:40:12,400 --> 00:40:14,400
so that my daughter may rest in peace,

439
00:40:16,760 --> 00:40:19,280
I have made this difficult decision.

440
00:40:21,920 --> 00:40:25,720
I've decided to set aside my dispute with Ms. Man for now...

441
00:40:26,480 --> 00:40:28,159
and let her take my daughter's remains...

442
00:40:28,160 --> 00:40:29,160
back to Australia.

443
00:40:29,960 --> 00:40:32,840
I hope everyone can respect this decision...

444
00:40:33,560 --> 00:40:34,560
and give us some space.

445
00:40:34,720 --> 00:40:36,000
Why the sudden change of heart?

446
00:40:36,080 --> 00:40:38,000
Are you worried voters will say you're being a hypocrite?

447
00:40:38,360 --> 00:40:39,640
How does the Glory Society view your decision?

448
00:40:39,720 --> 00:40:41,120
How will you explain this to your supporters?

449
00:40:42,840 --> 00:40:43,840
Thank you.

450
00:40:46,000 --> 00:40:47,560
Counselor Ma has finally conceded.

451
00:40:47,640 --> 00:40:49,080
How do you feel?

452
00:40:49,160 --> 00:40:50,520
Is there anything you would like to say?

453
00:40:51,120 --> 00:40:52,280
This is a huge turnaround.

454
00:40:52,360 --> 00:40:54,840
What did you do to make Counselor Ma change his mind?

455
00:40:55,520 --> 00:40:56,920
Can you ask your questions one at a time?

456
00:40:57,400 --> 00:40:59,080
How long did you negotiate...

457
00:40:59,160 --> 00:41:00,480
to reach this outcome?

458
00:41:00,920 --> 00:41:02,320
Can you give us more details?

459
00:41:02,440 --> 00:41:04,280
When do you plan to return to Australia?

460
00:41:06,520 --> 00:41:08,600
Did the staff member mean that...

461
00:41:08,920 --> 00:41:10,520
once Australia confirms everything,

462
00:41:10,600 --> 00:41:12,000
I can take Sze Ming and leave?

463
00:41:13,440 --> 00:41:15,760
These cases usually take a day or two.

464
00:41:17,640 --> 00:41:18,640
That's wonderful.

465
00:41:18,641 --> 00:41:20,280
I can finally take her home.
